---
import '@/styles/globals.css';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Página no encontrada — ExcelyDatos"
  description="La página que buscas no existe. Vuelve a la página de inicio de ExcelyDatos."
>
  <div class="min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center px-4">
    <div class="max-w-lg w-full text-center">

      <!-- 404 visual -->
      <div class="relative mb-8">
        <div class="text-[120px] sm:text-[160px] font-bold leading-none select-none">
          <span class="text-emerald-100 dark:text-emerald-900/40">4</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-200 dark:text-emerald-800/40">0</span>
          <span class="text-emerald-100 dark:text-emerald-900/40">4</span>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
          <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/30 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center shadow-sm">
            <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
              <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/>
              <path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"/>
              <line x1="11" y1="8" x2="11" y2="11"/>
              <line x1="11" y1="14" x2="11.01" y2="14"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h1 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1E293B] dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">
        Esta página no existe
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-8">
        Puede que la URL haya cambiado, que el artículo haya sido movido o que simplemente haya un error tipográfico. No te preocupes, desde aquí puedes volver a encontrar lo que buscabas.
      </p>

      <!-- Actions -->
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center mb-12">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-emerald-700 hover:bg-emerald-800 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors duration-200 shadow-sm"
        >
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/><polyline points="9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22"/></svg>
          Volver a la Home
        </a>
        <a
          href="/excel/"
          class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-700 text-[#1E293B] dark:text-slate-100 font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700 transition-colors duration-200"
        >
          Explorar Excel
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Quick links -->
      <div class="text-left bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-700 p-6 shadow-sm">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Artículos populares</p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li>
            <a href="/excel/como-sumar-celdas-en-excel/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
              <span class="badge-excel flex-shrink-0">Excel</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 group-hover:text-emerald-700 dark:group-hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">Cómo sumar celdas en Excel</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/powerbi/como-conectar-excel-con-power-bi/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
              <span class="badge-powerbi flex-shrink-0">Power BI</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 group-hover:text-amber-700 dark:group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">Cómo conectar Excel con Power BI</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/sql/que-es-un-select-en-sql/" class="flex items-center gap-3 group">
              <span class="badge-sql flex-shrink-0">SQL</span>
              <span class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 group-hover:text-sky-700 dark:group-hover:text-sky-400 transition-colors">¿Qué es un SELECT en SQL?</span>
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
